# Fomu PoC pin constraints — the full Fomu (PVT) pin set that the
# platform wrapper `module Top` (build/top.sv, from src/top.vir's
# `export mod Top for ice40::Fomu`) declares.  The ext core
# (\top::FomuTop) drives clock + usb_* + led_*; touch*/flash_* are the
# platform's standard pins (inputs dangling / outputs tied in the
# wrapper) and must still be constrained or nextpnr errors out.
# Pin map cross-checked against ~/repos/fomu-workshop/pcf/fomu-pvt.pcf.
set_io clock F4
set_io usb_dp A1
set_io usb_dn A2
set_io usb_dp_pu A4
set_io led_red B5
set_io led_green A5
set_io led_blue C5
set_io touch1 E4
set_io touch2 D5
set_io touch3 E5
set_io touch4 F5
set_io flash_cs C1
set_io flash_clk D1
set_io flash_mosi F1
set_io flash_miso E1
set_frequency clock 48.0